        "cooked": "<p>Apparently an attack +1 and an attack -1 token are supposed to cancel each other out:</p><p>https://boardgamegeek.com/article/18169810#18169810</p><p>I'm pretty sure this is missing from the rulebook, but they've been playing it this way at tournaments.</p>",
